{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/24ea494b228307a60d7f2681ba5069e7.poster.avif?t=1773934895\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/24ea494b228307a60d7f2681ba5069e7.webm?t=1773934895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/24ea494b228307a60d7f2681ba5069e7.mp4?t=1773934895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shadowy alleys of Arousbach, a city where new prohibition laws try to lock away certain pleasures, a tucked-away pastry shop offers more than meets the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Night Dessert</strong></i> is a cozy, narrative-driven visual novel where you play as a nocturnal bartender in a mysterious, late-night dessert shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, guests arrive. Humans, vampires, werewolves, and other nighttime souls, each with their own stories, desires, and confessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What they reveal depends on what you say.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wrapped in a jazz-filled atmosphere, Night Dessert is all about conversation, connection, and the strange beauty of the night.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/608dc3d6eae3e4014a15aec84b998e36.webp?t=1773934895\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/608dc3d6eae3e4014a15aec84b998e36.poster.avif?t=1773934895\" class=\"bb_img\" width=292 height=138 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>NEW: </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We are now (since August 7, 2025) completely AI-free!!!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All AI-generated tracks have been replaced with licensed ones.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3397770?t=1773934895","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773934895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/1313389b78deaa02ad86294b0ee42cd440a7ed8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773934895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/1313389b78deaa02ad86294b0ee42cd440a7ed8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773934895","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,4,5],"notes":"This game includes suggestive dialogue, flirtation, mild nudity, and playful innuendos, but remains non-explicit."},"demos":[{"appid":3400920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/24ea494b228307a60d7f2681ba5069e7.poster.avif?t=1773934895\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/24ea494b228307a60d7f2681ba5069e7.webm?t=1773934895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/24ea494b228307a60d7f2681ba5069e7.mp4?t=1773934895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shadowy alleys of Arousbach, a city where new prohibition laws try to lock away certain pleasures, a tucked-away pastry shop offers more than meets the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Night Dessert</strong></i> is a cozy, narrative-driven visual novel wher